{
  "changelog": "Initial release of huawei-cloud-storage-query (v1.0.0):\n\n- Provides read-only query access to Huawei Cloud storage resources (EVS/OBS/SFS/CBR).\n- All operations use bundled Python scripts via environment-controlled execution; no CLI or API calls permitted.\n- Supports querying disks, snapshots, bucket/object info, file system shares, backup vaults, policies, and related resource details.\n- Usage and parameter requirements are strictly documented in per-service guide.md files.\n- Includes a one-step environment validation and dependency check script.\n- No resource creation, modification, or deletion functions are included\u2014query only.",
